# relay-board-readpath.patch
#
# Target: scout-claude-relay worker (personal account), baseline VERSION 1.17.0.
# Apply MANUALLY to a locally redacted snapshot of the worker (see APPLY.md), then
# deploy via the project's control-plane-first path. HUMAN-GATED: deploy, routes, prod verify.
#
# This patch touches ONLY read-path handlers/helpers. It contains NO credentials:
# every changed region is far from the worker's embedded-secret block (see SECURITY-NOTE.md).
# Anchors are real lines from the v1.17.0 source; the `export` keyword is omitted because
# the worker's top-level helpers are plain declarations (the exported twin lives in
# relay-board-readpath.logic.mjs, kept identical for the tests).

